      "writtenOn": "2023-02-14T22:11:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, for some reason, because riscv does not have NDK_TRIPLE, when I try to cross compile Bazel `cc_binary`\u0027ies in riscv, it\u0027ll complain that the standard headers (e.g. `stdio.h`) is not found. Apparently for arm64 / x86_64, these headers are found from NDK_TRIPLE (probably under sysroot?). If we are dropping `NDK_TRIPLE`, where should these headers be found from?",
      "parentUuid": "42e69401_9baef64a",
      "revId": "7b5466b5457801e935469ddded2f1f6413aa4c3d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
